## Quick Start
sonar auth login
sonar integrate claude

## For AI Agents
Scan specific files with `sonar analyze secrets <file1> <file2>`. Do not scan whole trees with `.` or a repository-root path.
Use `sonar analyze` to scan changed files. For a required directory scan, use `--exclude <path>` to skip large directories. Repeat the option for each exact path or directory prefix; wildcards are not supported.
Use `sonar list issues --format toon` to output issues in a format optimized for LLM consumption.
Use `sonar list projects` to discover available projects before running analysis.
Commands marked with * require prior authentication via `sonar auth login`.
Aliases are shown next to a command name as `name|alias`.

